  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands Community Benefit Sharing Pilot Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to establish the institutional arrangements and capacity for Benefit Sharing Communities to manage a share of the revenues from the operation of a large-scale infrastructure investment project and to improve their basic services and skills for income generation during the construction period.</narrative>
  </description>
